				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1d4e95ac-8dca-4919-9220-ff6cea8040ca")
	)
	(text_box "Peak Strom bei 800V limitiert durch PTC's R25 = 1kOhm für 2S. -> 0,8A\nToleranz PTCEL = 30% -> 0,8/0,7 = 1,14A\n\nQ7 (IXTA08N100D2HV) Max Cont = 1,8A @ 100°C T_Die, Pulsed peak = 5A"
