	(text_box "Q6 PRECHARGE GATE TIMING / WORST CASE\n\nBestueckung:\nR50 = 10 kOhm\nR51 = 10 kOhm\nR52 = 1 kOhm\nR53 = 10 kOhm\nR54 = 1 kOhm\nC22 = 200 nF\nU7, U8 = TCLT1004\nD6 + D7 = ca. 1.7 V\n\nAnnahmen:\n+5 V liegt vor D6/D7\nV_C,U7 = 5.0 V - 1.7 V = 3.3 V\nVCEsat,U7 max = 0.3 V\n=> V_G,Q6,final,worst = 3.3 V - 0.3 V = 3.0 V\n\nU7 Eingang:\nIF_U7,min = (10 V - 1.6 V) / 1 kOhm = 8.4 mA\nIF_U7,max ~= (16 V - 1.25 V) / 1 kOhm = 14.8 mA\nIF_limit = 60 mA\n=> U7 LED Strom OK\n\nR54 Verlustleistung:\nP_R54 ~= (16 V - 1.25 V)^2 / 1 kOhm = 0.218 W\n=> R54 >= 0.25 W, Derating beachten\n\nU7 Ausgangsreserve:\nIC_U7,min = CTR_min * IF_U7,min\nIC_U7,min = 1.60 * 8.4 mA = 13.4 mA\n\nU7 Strombedarf bei V_G = 3.0 V:\nI_R51 = 3.0 V / 10 kOhm = 0.30 mA\nI_R52_U8 = (3.0 V - 1.6 V) / 1 kOhm = 1.40 mA\nI_C22_start = 3.0 V / 10 kOhm = 0.30 mA\nI_U7_req,max ~= 2.0 mA\n\n=> U7 Reserve: 13.4 mA / 2.0 mA = Faktor 6.7\n=> Gate-Endspannung Q6 worst case ca. 3.0 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 15.9084 0)
